tom.roddy@morganstanley.com wrote:
> I don't like polypiling, but I also don't like heaps of jumk all over
> the dungeon floor.  Is there a way to destroy objects you don't want?

Depending on what you consider being junk...

Wands - apply them. (Dangerous if still charged!)

Potions - throw them, or drop them while levitating.

Scrolls and books - zap a wand of fire (I suppose it works).

Rings - drop into sink.

Metallic loot - let it eat by some matallivore monster.

Organic material - dig a pit, drop into the pit, fill with boulder.
(May also be applied to other loot if you just want it not lying around.)

Assorted loot - put into any bag, let your pet pick the bag up, and let
the pet be disintegrated by a black dragon. (Well, call it a creative
solution, but I've been there done that... - unintentionally!)

